    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize learning by adapting explanations to a student’s level, providing instant feedback, and generating practice problems. They could also bridge gaps for students like me who struggle with abstract concepts by breaking them into simpler steps or offering interactive examples."
